Added `hco-core db upgrade`, which upgrades the schema and makes the checkpointer tables, and `hco-core serve api`, which starts the API on 127.0.0.1:8080.
Added a check that refuses the public `HCO_VALIDATION_KEY` of `development/.env` with a connection other than `mock`.
Added a development compose stack with Postgres and the API. The README quick start takes a fixture change to `APPROVED` in nine commands.
